  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: 6 miles E Abydos TKY and cites \"RE 5,\" which is clearly an error for \"RE 1\".</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "A river, mentioned in Homer and later sources, that BAtlas places in Asia Minor, draining into the Hellespont \"6 miles E Abydos (Maltepe)\" in modern Turkey. Pauly's RE puts it in the same general area, but makes it a tributary of the Rhodios.",
